    "description": "<p>When you deal damage to one or more enemies with a spell, you may spend 1 Grave Point. If you do, choose one option:</p><ul><li><p>Choose one of those enemies, and the spell deals extra damage equal to <strong>【SL + the number of status effects the chosen enemy is suffering from】</strong>.</p></li><li><p>Each of those enemies suffers <strong>shaken</strong> after the effects of the spell are resolved.</p></li></ul><hr><p><strong>Resource:</strong> @PROGRESS[beyond-the-realms-of-death update -1]{Spend 1 Grave Point}</p>",
